(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"4efb576d-af3e-4a26-b233-9464fe0d4046\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-5\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1g07jvy\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"53\">Sony PlayStation 5 Game – Bleach: Rebirth of Souls</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"393\">Duik in de spectaculaire wereld van Bleach met <em data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"128\">Bleach: Rebirth of Souls</em> voor de Sony PlayStation 5. Beleef intense gevechten, indrukwekkende anime-graphics en actievolle gameplay gebaseerd op de populaire Bleach-serie. Kies jouw favoriete personages en gebruik krachtige aanvallen en unieke vaardigheden om je tegenstanders te verslaan.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"529\">Deze complete editie wordt geleverd inclusief originele hoes en disc. Het spel verkeert in nette staat en werkt volledig naar behoren.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dhqvak\" data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"548\">Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"742\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1urow9y\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"574\">Platform: PlayStation 5</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tpfsw4\" data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"608\">Titel: Bleach: Rebirth of Souls</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"107sw7g\" data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"635\">Genre: Fighting / Action</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x5jkbg\" data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"650\">Taal: Engels</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11xqklj\" data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"680\">Conditie: Compleet met doos</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c06hbe\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"711\">Staat: Goede gebruikte staat</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jg1uct\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"742\">Garantie: 3 maanden garantie</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1p874hr\" data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"776\">Waarom kiezen voor dit spel?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10xmm6z\" data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"808\">Spectaculaire anime-gevechten</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"165429j\" data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"848\">Populaire Bleach-personages speelbaar</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19iixa1\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"879\">Vloeiende gameplay op de PS5</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"675ybe\" data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"917\">Mooie graphics en snelle laadtijden</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11oflgn\" data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"964\">Ideaal voor fans van anime en fighting games</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1g4ul3x\" data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"987\">Bij ons krijg je:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1160\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p9fh3o\" data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1008\">3 maanden garantie</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1egvjjp\" data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1083\">Mogelijkheid tot inruil van je smartphone, console of andere elektronica</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ae57m0\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1118\">Ophalen in de winkel in Roermond</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tystdf\" data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1160\">Of eenvoudig bestellen via onze webshop</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3hrus3\" data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1037\">Ophalen of bestellen</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1058\">Je kunt dit product:</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1240\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hfgwa0\" data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1124\">Ophalen in onze winkel in <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\">Roermond</span></li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y03m8q\" data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1163\">Eenvoudig bestellen via onze webshop</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
